    "searchCoverage": "Official Apple Ads Platform API is OAuth2 client_credentials. The client_secret is a locally signed ES256 JWT (iss=teamId, sub=clientId, aud=https://appleid.apple.com, kid=keyId). Pinned source signs that JWT then POSTs appleid.apple.com/auth/oauth2/token and sends Bearer access_token to api.ads.apple.com. Native http.auth cannot sign JWTs or express that token exchange. GET /v1/me is a cheap authenticated read only after the token exists. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying unresolved Ads Platform API compromise.",
    "incidents": [
      {
